.TH GIMME 1 "2026-08-04" "gimme 0.1.0" "gimme Manual"
.SH NAME
gimme \- a Swift\-based package manager for macOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gimme
[\fIGLOBAL OPTIONS\fR]
\fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR] [\fICOMMAND OPTIONS\fR]
.sp
.B gimme
\fITOOL\fR[@\fIVERSION\fR]
\(ba the install/update shortcut (signature UX)

.SH DESCRIPTION
gimme installs command\-line tools via formulae (typed TOML manifests plus
optionally a sandboxed Lua install script). It uses a versioned cellar with
PATH shims, supports source\-based and download\-based installs, reads
.IR .tool-versions / mise.toml ,
and coexists with mise/asdf by deferring to tools they already manage.

.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BR "--json" " (bool)"
Emit structured JSON output (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.TP
.BR "--dry-run" " (bool)"
Plan mutations without executing (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.TP
.BR "--yes" " (bool)"
Non-interactive confirm (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.TP
.BR "--prefix" " (string)"
Override ~/.gimme location (default: \fI~/.gimme\fR)
.TP
.BR "--tap" " (string)"
Restrict to one tap
.TP
.BR "--verbose" " (bool)"
Debug logging (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.TP
.BR "--no-color" " (bool)"
Disable color output (default: \fIfalse\fR)

.SH COMMANDS
.SS \fBinstall\fR
.RS
Install a tool (auto-detects .tool-versions/mise.toml with no args).
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme install <tool>[@version]\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool?
.sp
Options:
.RS
\fB--dry-run\fR (bool) \(em Plan without executing (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RS
\fB--insecure\fR (bool) \(em Skip checksum verification (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RS
\fB--from-mise\fR (bool) \(em Read mise/asdf config and install batch (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RS
\fB--no-mise\fR (bool) \(em Disable auto-detection of mise config (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RE
.SS \fBuninstall\fR
.RS
Remove a tool.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme uninstall <tool>[@version]\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool
.sp
Options:
.RS
\fB--force\fR (bool) \(em Remove even if depended on (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RE
.SS \fBupdate\fR
.RS
Update one or all tools.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme update [<tool>]|--all\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool?
.sp
Options:
.RS
\fB--all\fR (bool) \(em Update every non-pinned tool (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RS
\fB--check\fR (bool) \(em Report outdated, do not update (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RE
.SS \fBuse\fR
.RS
Switch active version (no download).
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme use <tool> <version>\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool, version
.RE
.SS \fBpin\fR
.RS
Pin a tool to a version.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme pin <tool>[@version]\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool
.RE
.SS \fBunpin\fR
.RS
Remove a pin.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme unpin <tool>\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool
.RE
.SS \fBlist\fR
.RS
List installed tools.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme list [--all]\fR
.sp
Options:
.RS
\fB--all\fR (bool) \(em Include not-installed formulae (default: \fIfalse\fR)
.RE
.RS
\fB--limit\fR (int) \(em Cap number of results
.RE
.RS
\fB--fields\fR (string) \(em Project specific fields
.RE
.RS
\fB--query\fR (string) \(em Filter expression
.RE
.RE
.SS \fBsearch\fR
.RS
Search formulae.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme search <term>\fR
.sp
Arguments: term
.RE
.SS \fBinfo\fR
.RS
Show formula details.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme info <tool>\fR
.sp
Arguments: tool
.RE
.SS \fBoutdated\fR
.RS
Show tools with updates available.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme outdated\fR
.RE
.SS \fBtap\fR
.RS
Manage formula sources.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme tap <add|remove|list> [url]\fR
.sp
Arguments: action, url?
.RE
.SS \fBdoctor\fR
.RS
Health check.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme doctor\fR
.RE
.SS \fBconfig\fR
.RS
Read/write config.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme config <get|set> [key] [value]\fR
.sp
Arguments: action, key?, value?
.RE
.SS \fBintrospect\fR
.RS
Emit machine-readable CLI spec.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme introspect [--command <name>]\fR
.sp
Options:
.RS
\fB--command\fR (string) \(em Scope to one command
.RE
.RE
.SS \fBman\fR
.RS
Emit groff man-page source to stdout.
.sp
Usage: \fBgimme man\fR
.RE

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
\fISUCCESS\fR
.TP
.B 1
\fIUSAGE\fR
.TP
.B 1
\fINOT_FOUND\fR
.TP
.B 2
\fIINSTALL\fR
.TP
.B 2
\fICHECKSUM\fR
.TP
.B 2
\fIPERMISSION\fR
.TP
.B 2
\fINETWORK\fR
.TP
.B 3
\fICONFLICT\fR
.TP
.B 4
\fILOCK\fR
.TP
.B 70
\fIUNKNOWN\fR

.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.gimme/
Default install prefix: bin/ (shims), cellar/<tool>/<ver>/, cache/, taps/, state/.
.TP
.B ~/.gimme/config.toml
User configuration (behavior, cache, taps).

.SH SEE ALSO
Full documentation: \fBhttps://greg.github.io/gimme/\fR (or your deployed site).
Design spec and decision log: the \fIDECISIONS.md\fR and
\fIdocs/superpowers/specs/\fR files in the source tree.
